WIZYBOO API SERVICES
====================
Service ID: wapi
Module: WizyBoo API Services
Version: 0.1-placeholder
Status: PLACEHOLDER - implementation required

PURPOSE
Connect WizyBoo modules through a documented internal service interface.

PLANNED MODULES
- wzlm.ser: Windows Live Messenger troubleshooting and compatible-service support
- wvs2012.ser: Visual Studio 2012 and .NET Framework 3.5 troubleshooting

PLANNED RESPONSIBILITIES
- Route requests to registered WizyBoo modules
- Validate module and request identifiers
- Return structured success and error statuses
- Record diagnostic information without storing passwords or secrets
- Provide a future integration point for approved online services

REQUEST FORMAT (PLANNED)
module=<module-id>
action=<action-name>
version=<module-version>

RESPONSE FORMAT (PLANNED)
status=<ok|error|not_implemented>
message=<human-readable-result>

SECURITY NOTES
- Do not put API keys, passwords, or private tokens in this file.
- Validate all requests before passing them to a module.
- Use authenticated, encrypted connections when online services are implemented.

IMPORTANT
This is a project specification placeholder, not executable API code.
No endpoints or live network connections are configured yet.
